{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22379","headline":"别行简 · 白居易","name":"别行简","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠病眼花，星星愁鬓雪。\n筋骸已衰惫，形影仍分诀。\n梓州二千里，劒门五六月。\n岂是远行时，火云烧栈热。\n何言巾上泪，乃是肠中血。\n念此早归来，莫作经年别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}